        <mxCell id="c426" value="What the matrix says" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="994" width="700" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c427" value="1 &#183; The top of the industry list was already the top of ours — forecasting and inventory 8/8,&#xa;       recommendations 7/8, chatbots 6/8. That is confirmation, not new information.&#xa;&#xa;2 &#183; Pricing is the biggest hole: 4 sources including Oracle&#39;s entire product line, and the&#xa;       loudest numbers in the whole set. Neither earlier folder touched it.   &#8594;  I01&#xa;&#xa;3 &#183; Oracle&#39;s page is worth more than the other seven combined for gap-finding — it names&#xa;       operational products, not themes. Four of the eight new plans came from that one page.&#xa;&#xa;4 &#183; Sustainability turns out to be a pricing problem: near-expiry stock is either marked down&#xa;       at the right time or written off.   &#8594;  I02, an extension of I01, with a hard KPI.&#xa;&#xa;5 &#183; Every source&#39;s CHALLENGES list says the same thing — review AI decisions, measure real&#xa;       business impact, privacy. Not one of them says model accuracy.   &#8594;  I06" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1024" width="780" height="268" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c428" value="Coverage after this folder" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="870" y="994" width="620" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c429" value="10" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="870" y="1028" width="60" height="32" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c430" value="Covered by an existing plan  (N or V sets)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="940" y="1028" width="560" height="32" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c431" value="8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="870" y="1068" width="60" height="32" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
